assessment of circumstances of the child, or on a request from the ITF, or a 
direction from the CPC, till the matter is concluded and even thereafter. This shall 
include counselling, medical assistance, reasonable assistance to the person for 
purposes of filing a written complaint, referral to agencies approved by the 
Foundation for various support services, as may be required by the child; 


